PLAN-ROOT SINK
|
00:SCAN PAIMON [functional_parquet.paimon_partitioned]
    predicates: rating > 3
    paimon predicates: rating > 3, userid = 1
    paimon partition predicates: userid = 1
    row-size=20B cardinality=5
====
select * from functional_parquet.paimon_partitioned where userid=1;
