    paimon partition predicates: userid IN (1, 2, 3)
    row-size=20B cardinality=1
====
select * from functional_parquet.paimon_partitioned where userid between 1 and 3 and rating>=4;
---- PLAN
PLAN-ROOT SINK
|
00:SCAN PAIMON [functional_parquet.paimon_partitioned]
    predicates: rating >= 4
    paimon predicates: rating >= 4, userid <= 3, userid >= 1
    paimon partition predicates: userid <= 3, userid >= 1
    row-size=20B cardinality=23
====
